# KSI-MLA-OSM: Azure Log Analytics Workspace - Centralized Logging
# Validates LAW exists with adequate retention for SIEM capability

META
    esp_id `ksi-mla-osm-az-log-analytics-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `azure`
    criticality `high`

    title `KSI-MLA-OSM: Azure Log Analytics - centralized logging workspace`
    description `Validates that a Log Analytics workspace is provisioned and operational with at least 30 days retention, providing centralized tamper-resistant logging for SIEM capability`
    author `security-team`
    tags `azure,log-analytics,siem,logging,retention,monitoring`

    control_mapping `KSI:KSI-MLA-OSM,KSI:KSI-MLA-RVL,NIST:AU-6,NIST:SI-4`
    control_objective `KSI-MLA-OSM`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `cloud-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `7`
    recommendation `Ensure Log Analytics workspace has at least 90 days retention and is connected to all diagnostic settings for centralized log collection`

    impl_KSI_MLA_OSM `SIEM capability is validated by confirming a Log Analytics workspace exists (found=true) and is actively provisioned (provisioningState=Succeeded) with a retention period of at least 30 days (retentionInDays>=30). The workspace serves as the centralized, tamper-resistant log repository for Azure Monitor, Microsoft Defender for Cloud, and Azure Sentinel, aggregating security events, diagnostic logs, and activity logs from across the subscription for correlation, analysis, and incident response.`

    impl_KSI_MLA_RVL `Log review capability is supported by the Log Analytics workspace providing queryable, indexed storage of all ingested log data with KQL query support for audit and investigation workflows.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT law_demo
        name `law-example-prod`
        resource_group `rg-example-eastus`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE st_law_operational
        found boolean = true
        provisioning_state string = `Succeeded`
        retention_in_days int >= 30
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN az_log_analytics_workspace
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF st_law_operational
            OBJECT_REF law_demo
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
